    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba9078e12fdac9c05a8556c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的训练也告一段落了。\n突然间我注意到，爱丽速子在看着\n远处的某个人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdce9c52529b5710eabbfa859c4de2072421bb6e9be53135810a327856104bfd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
